5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The morning bottleneck is unacceptable. We need a system that guarantees access, not just a place to park.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to understand the financial reality before we discuss access. What is the actual cost of losing a parking spot?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I worry the current spots are just habit, not need. I want to see if the bikes actually match the spaces.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I care about the social friction. We need a system that doesn't turn neighbors into rivals over a concrete slab.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I worry about who actually does the work. The last two jobs just vanished because nobody wanted to keep them running.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, the cost is my time and safety. I need to know if the current layout is the root cause of the chaos.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, time is real, but I need the ledger to see if we are already overspending on maintenance.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, I agree. Friction is real. I need to know if the current arrangement is just old habit or actual need.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, habit is dangerous. I want to see if the current setup is already breeding resentment before it explodes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I agree. Friction is real, but I need to know if the workload is sustainable before we pick a system.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, I agree. If the system collapses, the chaos returns. I need to verify the actual daily usage patterns to design a fair rotation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, I agree. But without the ledger, we are guessing. I need to see if the building can even afford the proposed fixes.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Mio, I understand. But I need to verify if the current spots are actually used or just claimed by habit.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I hear you. But if the workload kills the system, the friction just gets worse. I need to see the history of these disputes.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, I agree. If the system collapses, the chaos returns. I need to verify the actual daily usage patterns to design a fair rotation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the building account's two-year ledger and the Treasurer's handover file on cash collections.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will look into the sticker register and the daily riders and the five years of association minutes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into the last year's complaint log entries and the account from the neighbouring block's secretary.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will look into the trial of the supplier's display frame and the five years of association minutes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
